art. \n\nI should check if the rollout restart command is necessary. Sometimes, changing the image without rolling out might not apply the changes. So, executing kubectl rollout restart deployment/rate -n hotel-reservation separately makes sense. \n\nI need to make sure that the command is correctly formatted without any shell operators. Using the exec_kubectl_cmd_safely tool again for the rollout command should work. If this succeeds, the deployment should update, and the pod should start correctly. If there's another error, maybe the image is incorrect, or the container's command is still misconfigured. But based on the previous steps, this should be the next logical step.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl rollout restart deployment/rate -n hotel-reservation"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-9ccd18bb86cd9dfc', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 353, 'prompt_tokens': 4573, 'total_tokens': 4926, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfc1f-2c68-7c80-8b5a-16c52a12e50d-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl rollout restart deployment/rate -n hotel-reservation'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-9ccd18bb86cd9dfc', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4573, 'output_tokens': 353, 'total_tokens': 4926}), ToolMessage(content='deployment.apps/rate restarted\n', id='bd97d86b-e093-426e-b5fd-52b1159ffeb0', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-9ccd18bb86cd9dfc'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='95d5bb2a-26ba-4214-8952-d2c